<title>USA: FSA says has capacity for WPPSS 1,2 and 3 revs.</title>
<headline>FSA says has capacity for WPPSS 1,2 and 3 revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said it has additional secondary market insurance capacity for the following issue:</p>
<p>Washington Public Power Supply System revenue bonds Projects 1, 2 and 3.</p>
<p>Capacity is available on a first-come, first serve basis.</p>
<p>For further details, please call Tom Byrne, Greg Haggerty, or Alan Steinfeld at 212-826-0601.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
